#!/bin/sh

set -eu

cat >&2 <<'EOF'
error: an unsandboxed Rust build was refused by this repository

Cargo build scripts and procedural macros execute native dependency code.
Use one of the sandboxed entry points instead, for example:

    make run
    make sandbox-check
    make sandbox-test
    make sandbox-app
    ./tools/sandbox-cargo <cargo command> [arguments...]

See docs/build-security.md for the boundary and its limitations.
EOF

exit 86
